    "yamlSchema": "name: frontend-dev\nversion: \"1.0.0\"\ndescription: \"Full-stack frontend with cinematic animations, high-performance interactions, and generative art.\"\nparameters:\n  type: object\n  properties:\n    targetScene:\n      type: string\n      description: \"Scene or interaction module\"\nrequired:\n  - targetScene",
    "skillMd": "---\nname: frontend-dev\ndescription: |\n  Full-stack frontend with cinematic animations, high-performance interactions, and generative art. Useful for hero pages, showcases, and creative web artifacts.\nauthor: repo.fw\ncopyright: \"Copyright (c) repo.fw. All rights reserved.\"\ntriggers:\n  - \"frontend dev\"\n  - \"cinematic frontend\"\n  - \"generative web\"\n  - \"hero page\"\n  - \"showcase site\"\nod:\n  mode: prototype\n  category: web-artifacts\n---\n\n# Cinematic Frontend Engineering\n\nGuidelines for building memorable, high-performance creative web interfaces and interactive showcase pages.\n\n## Directives\n\n1. **Cinematic Immersion**: Use subtle scroll-driven camera movements, layered depth effects, and choreographed entrance animations.\n2. **Performance First**: Ensure zero layout thrashing by animating strictly on GPU-composited layers (`transform` and `opacity`).\n3. **Typography as Structure**: Let bold, oversized editorial type anchor the composition without relying on generic stock art.\n\n---\n\n© repo.fw. All rights reserved.\n"
