    "yamlSchema": "name: frontend-skill\nversion: \"1.0.0\"\ndescription: \"Frontend design and implementation principles for restrained, impactful landing pages.\"\nparameters:\n  type: object\n  properties:\n    sectionType:\n      type: string\n      description: \"Page layout or section\"\nrequired:\n  - sectionType",
    "skillMd": "---\nname: frontend-skill\ndescription: |\n  Create visually strong landing pages, websites, and app UIs with restrained composition and production-grade frontend playbooks.\nauthor: repo.fw\ncopyright: \"Copyright (c) repo.fw. All rights reserved.\"\ntriggers:\n  - \"landing page\"\n  - \"frontend playbook\"\n  - \"ui composition\"\n  - \"restrained ui\"\nod:\n  mode: design-system\n  category: design-systems\n---\n\n# Frontend Design Playbook\n\nDesign and implementation principles for restrained, impactful landing pages and web applications.\n\n## Principles\n\n1. **Restraint Over Excess**: Generous negative space, disciplined color counts (1 dominant, 1 subtle accent), and clean visual rhythm.\n2. **Intentional Alignment**: Strict grid adherence with deliberate breaking elements to draw the eye.\n3. **Readable Hierarchy**: Ensure content can be scanned in 5 seconds with clear heading levels and typographic contrast.\n\n---\n\n© repo.fw. All rights reserved.\n"
