    "yamlSchema": "name: shadcn-ui\nversion: \"1.0.0\"\ndescription: \"Build UI components with shadcn/ui based on Radix UI primitives.\"\nparameters:\n  type: object\n  properties:\n    component:\n      type: string\n      description: \"shadcn component name\"\nrequired:\n  - component",
    "skillMd": "---\nname: shadcn-ui\ndescription: |\n  Build UI components with shadcn/ui. Ships structured, accessible Radix-primitive based components quickly.\nauthor: repo.fw\ncopyright: \"Copyright (c) repo.fw. All rights reserved.\"\ntriggers:\n  - \"shadcn\"\n  - \"shadcn ui\"\n  - \"shadcn components\"\n  - \"accessible components\"\nod:\n  mode: design-system\n  category: design-systems\n---\n\n# shadcn/ui Component Architecture\n\nStandard conventions for creating, theming, and extending accessible UI components based on Radix UI primitives and Tailwind CSS.\n\n## Guidelines\n\n1. **Copy/Paste Architecture**: Components live directly in the project codebase (`components/ui`), not as an opaque npm dependency.\n2. **CSS Variables for Theming**: Keep all colors mapped to semantic variables (`--background`, `--foreground`, `--primary`, `--muted`).\n3. **Accessibility Out-of-the-Box**: Retain full keyboard navigation, ARIA attributes, and focus-visible rings provided by Radix primitives.\n\n---\n\n© repo.fw. All rights reserved.\n"
